  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-canvas-getcontext and https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-offscreencanvas-getcontext each define a table, but we do not use consistent language around exceptions.\r\n\r\nI think it would be clearer if we rewrote the \"steps\" cell's contents using actual steps with `<ol>` as container and `<li><p>` signifying the steps when there's multiple steps. We would then not have to check whether an exception is thrown as exceptions would exit the algorithm early anyway.\r\n\r\nAnd we should ensure we use the same language in both to the extent possible.",
